# https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/ExternalRefType/vulnerabilityExploitabilityAssessment node976
node976 [ shape=none, color=black label=< <table color='#666666' cellborder='0' cellspacing='0' border='1'><tr><td colspan='2' bgcolor='grey'><B>vulnerabilityExploitabilityAssessment</B></td></tr><tr><td href='https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/ExternalRefType/vulnerabilityExploitabilityAssessment' bgcolor='#eeeeee' colspan='2'><font point-size='10' color='#6666ff'>https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/ExternalRefType/vulnerabilityExploitabilityAssessment</font></td></tr><tr><td align='left'>rdfs:comment</td><td align='left'>&quot;A reference to a Vulnerability Exploitability eXchange (VEX) statement which provides information on whether a product is impacted by a specific vulnerability in an included package and, if affected, whether there are actions recommended to remediate. See also [NTIA VEX one-page summary](https://ntia.gov/files/ntia/publications/vex_one-page_summary.pdf).&quot;@en</td></tr></table> > ] 
